in, delicate facial features, slim tall proportions and an elegant feminine presence is the sole living performer. Her face, hairstyle, earrings, skin tone, body proportions and identity remain completely consistent throughout the entire video.\n\nAt the opening frame she wears the exact outfit shown in <Picture 1>: a soft light aqua-blue satin camisole top with thin spaghetti straps, a relaxed draped cowl neckline, a slightly loose elegant silhouette, paired with a matching aqua-blue high-waisted draped midi skirt featuring a gathered knot detail at the right hip and a high front-right thigh slit. She wears clean white pointed-toe high heels and a delicate necklace and bracelet. The fabric has realistic satin softness, natural folds and subtle highlights.\n\nFive flat wardrobe-selection graphics attached naturally to the visual composition surround her. Each clothing, footwear and dashed outline set is one complete linked wardrobe group. The wardrobe graphics are static, clearly separated from the performer and fully visible at the beginning.\n\nWardrobe group 1 at the upper left: a pale blush-pink ivory-toned floral lace mini slip dress with thin spaghetti straps, delicate semi-transparent floral lace texture, straight neckline, fitted upper body, softly flared mini skirt and scalloped lace hem, paired with cream-beige glossy patent Mary Jane platform heels with ankle straps.\n\nWardrobe group 2 at the upper right: a brown-and-black leopard-print asymmetrical one-shoulder fitted crop top with a single shoulder strap and structured bustier silhouette, paired with high-waisted black denim cutoff shorts with visible front pockets, button closure and rough frayed hems, paired with black strappy high-heel sandals with thin straps and elegant stiletto heels.\n\nWardrobe group 3 at the middle left: a deep emerald-green velvet floor-length evening gown with a halter neckline, plunging V-shaped front opening, fitted torso, gathered and ruched waist construction, sculptural draped velvet folds, a dramatic high thigh slit and long column silhouette, paired with black strappy stiletto sandals.\n\nWardrobe group 4 at the lower right: a pale champagne-silver glittering sequin mini dress with a delicate shimmering surface, fitted bodycon silhouette, thin straps, softly structured neckline, subtle gathered details and a short above-knee hem, paired with champagne-nude metallic strappy high-heel sandals with thin elegant straps and high heels.\n\nWardrobe group 5 at the lower left: a black lace slip mini dress with thin spaghetti straps, delicate floral lace texture, deep V neckline, fitted feminine silhouette and scalloped lace hem, paired with black fishnet stockings and glossy black patent pointed-toe stiletto pumps.\n\nEach wardrobe group has a clean white dashed outline surrounding the complete clothing and footwear set, matching the reference image. The dashed outlines remain clearly visible and visually attached to their respective wardrobe groups.\n\nFrom the first frame, the woman walks continuously toward the camera with a natural rhythmic runway stride through the luxury living room. Her movement is elegant and controlled: alternating feet, clear heel strikes, smooth weight transfer, subtle natural hip movement, relaxed shoulders, natural opposite arm swing led by the elbows, and graceful posture. She walks directly toward the camera while maintaining eye contact with the camera between selections.\n\nThe camera smoothly tracks backward at her walking speed in one continuous shot, maintaining a stable front-facing full-body composition. Her head, hands, legs, feet and shoes remain fully visible throughout. No camera cuts, no sudden zooms, no changes of lens perspective, no camera shake.\n\nAt 1.81 seconds her left index finger travels diagonally up-left toward wardrobe group 1 while her gaze naturally follows toward the pink lace dress. At 2.14 seconds her fingertip reaches the center of group 1. Every white dashed outline surrounding the pink lace dress and cream Mary Jane heels instantly brightens and thickens into a luminous electric-white selection outline. At 2.31 seconds, exactly on the musical beat, the selected wardrobe group activates and she instantly changes into the complete wardrobe group 1: the pale blush-pink floral lace mini slip dress and cream-beige glossy patent Mary Jane platform heels.\n\nThe transformation is instantaneous and clean, with no body deformation, no extra limbs and no transition artifacts. The selected dress, shoes and their dashed selection outline fade out within two frames, leaving the surrounding background clean. Wardrobe groups 2, 3, 4 and 5 remain fully visible. Her walking motion continues seamlessly without stopping or changing direction.\n\nAt 4.12 seconds her right index finger travels diagonally up-right toward wardrobe group 2. Her eyes briefly follow the leopard-print outfit. At 4.45 seconds her fingertip reaches the center of group 2 and all dashed outlines surrounding the leopard-print crop top, black shorts and black sandals brighten and thicken. At 4.62 seconds, exactly on the beat, she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 2: the brown-and-black leopard-print one-shoulder crop top, high-waisted black frayed denim shorts and black strappy stiletto sandals.\n\nThe selected wardrobe graphics disappear within two frames, leaving a clean background. Wardrobe groups 3, 4 and 5 remain fully visible. Her stride remains continuous and natural.\n\nAt 6.42 seconds her left index finger travels horizontally toward wardrobe group 3 on the left side. Her gaze turns naturally toward the emerald-green gown. At 6.75 seconds her fingertip reaches the center of the gown and its dashed outline brightens and thickens into a luminous electric-white selection outline. At 6.92 seconds, exactly on the beat, she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 3: the deep emerald-green velvet halter floor-length gown with plunging neckline, sculptural gathered waist, dramatic thigh-high slit and black strappy stiletto sandals.\n\nThe selected gown, sandals and dashed outline disappear within two frames, leaving the interior background clean. Wardrobe groups 4 and 5 remain visible. Her walking rhythm continues uninterrupted.\n\nAt 8.73 seconds her right index finger travels diagonally down-right toward wardrobe group 4. Her gaze follows the shimmering champagne-silver sequin mini dress. At 9.06 seconds her fingertip reaches the center of group 4 and all dashed outlines around the dress and sandals brighten and thicken. At 9.23 seconds, exactly on the beat, she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 4: the pale champagne-silver glittering sequin mini dress and champagne-nude metallic strappy high-heel sandals.\n\nThe selected dress, sandals and dashed outline fade out within two frames. Wardrobe group 5 remains fully visible. Her walking motion remains smooth and continuous.\n\nAt 11.04 seconds her left index finger travels diagonally down-left toward wardrobe group 5. Her gaze follows the black lace dress. At 11.37 seconds her fingertip reaches the center of group 5 and the dashed outlines surrounding the black lace dress, fishnet stockings and black pointed pumps brighten and thicken into a luminous electric-white selection outline. At 11.54 seconds, exactly on the beat, she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 5: a fitted black floral lace slip mini dress with thin spaghetti straps, deep V neckline and scalloped lace hem, paired with black fishnet stockings and glossy black patent pointed-toe stiletto pumps.\n\nThe selected dress, stockings, pumps and dashed outline fade out within two frames. All five wardrobe graphics have now disappeared.\n\nFrom 11.54 seconds onward, the composition contains only the performer inside the clean luxury living room. She continues walking toward the camera wearing the complete black lace outfit. The warm interior lighting creates subtle highlights on the lace texture, stockings and glossy patent shoes.\n\nNear 12.70 seconds, while continuing forward, one hand gently touches and slightly lifts the edge of the black lace hem in a subtle fashion-editorial gesture. The movement is elegant and restrained, without breaking her walking rhythm.\n\nAt 13.85 seconds, on the final strong musical beat, she completes one final step and stops naturally. Her weight settles onto the front leg, the rear leg extends slightly behind, one hand rests naturally near her waist while the other relaxes beside her body. She slightly lifts her chin and looks directly into the camera with a confident, elegant expression and a subtle closed-lip smile.\n\nThe final pose holds naturally until 15.00 seconds. The camera remains stable and the luxury living room stays unchanged in the background. No additional people enter the scene.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nClear, elegant high-heel footsteps synchronize naturally with her runway stride over a subtle premium indoor ambience. The room contains very soft natural interior ambience with no traffic, rain or outdoor city noise. Each wardrobe selection produces one short refined interface blip. Each outfit transformation produces one restrained fashion-style whoosh. Each disappearing wardrobe graphic produces one soft shimmering sound. The performer remains completely silent throughout the video with relaxed closed lips.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nA strong high-fashion House beat at 130 BPM is already playing at full volume from the first frame. The music is driven by a punchy four-on-the-floor kick, crisp electronic claps, a steady bass pulse, restrained luxury-fashion synth textures and short bright rhythmic accents.\n\nFrom 0.00 seconds to 13.85 seconds the beat maintains consistent energy and loudness. Clear impact accents occur exactly at 2.31, 4.62, 6.92, 9.23 and 11.54 seconds, synchronized precisely with each outfit transformation.\n\nA final full kick and bright synth impact land at 13.85 seconds when she completes the final fashion pose, followed by a short powerful musical tail that resolves exactly at 15.00 seconds.\n\nVisual continuity requirements:\n\nThe woman must remain the exact same person throughout the entire video. Her facial identity, hairstyle, skin tone, body proportions and height must remain unchanged. Outfit changes affect only clothing, stockings and footwear. No face morphing, no hairstyle changes, no body-shape changes, no extra fingers, no extra limbs, no duplicated shoes, no warped clothing and no deformation of the hands or feet.\n\nThe luxury living room, furniture, marble surfaces, wooden wall panels, artwork, sofa and coffee table remain spatially consistent throughout the entire shot. The wardrobe graphics are flat visual selection elements integrated into the scene and should not physically collide with the performer.\n\nThe entire video is one continuous uninterrupted camera shot with smooth backward camera tracking, realistic human walking biomechanics, photorealistic fabric simulation, physically plausible lighting and premium fashion-editorial cinematography.", 1344, 768, 124, "I2VA — 图生音视频（首帧）", "native", 1, false, 1, true, "match", "official_2_to_15s", true], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 387, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "video_vae", "link": 388, "label": "video_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "video_vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 390, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "drive_audio", "label": "drive_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "drive_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "final_audio", "label": "final_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "final_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 323, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_i